      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Specifies the page segment of resources that return.",
      "contextAfter": "```console\nPOST https://api.searchads.apple.com/api/v5/campaigns/find\n\n{  \n  \"fields\": [\n    \"id\",\n    \"name\",\n    \"adamId\",\n    \"budgetAmount\",\n    \"dailyBudgetAmount\",\n    \"status\",\n    \"servingStatus\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"field\": \"servingStatus\",\n      \"operator\": \"IN\",\n      \"values\": [\n        \"NOT_RUNNING\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"orderBy\": [\n    {\n      \"field\": \"id\",\n      \"sortOrder\": \"DESCENDING\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"pagination\": {\n    \"offset\": 0,\n    \"limit\": 10\n  }\n}\n\n```",
      "documentTitle": "Selector",
      "framework": "Apple Ads",
